From 6a7601c0a2e4d7861cf1bbf6710b2a1a924fa29b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ignacio Duart <iduartgomez@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 09:39:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 32/69] fix: add mobile-responsive layout with drawer
 navigation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The three-column layout (RoomList + Conversation + MemberList) was
completely broken on mobile — fixed-width sidebars (w-64 + w-56 = 480px)
exceeded mobile viewport widths causing overlap.

- Add mobile header bar with hamburger (rooms) and members toggle buttons
- Sidebars show as full-screen overlays on mobile, hidden by default
- Use md: breakpoint to preserve desktop 3-column layout unchanged
- Close rooms drawer automatically when a room is selected
- Hide logo in sidebar on mobile (shown in mobile header instead)
- Remove stale CSS media query targeting non-existent class names

Fixes #141
